WEBVTT

00:08.908 --> 00:10.068
Where am I?

00:13.713 --> 00:14.975
Tower Gate...

00:15.281 --> 00:17.476
I must be in Undertown.

00:20.587 --> 00:21.519
An explosion?

00:33.400 --> 00:36.335
Hey!
What are you planning on doing?!

00:36.836 --> 00:37.928
What do you think?!

00:40.540 --> 00:42.531
I'm going to go check it out!

00:42.609 --> 00:44.304
Rumina!

00:50.817 --> 00:51.784
I don't know.

00:53.086 --> 00:55.418
I don't know what's going on...

00:55.488 --> 00:57.581
...but I feel like I've got to
go there!

00:58.058 --> 01:02.859
The Company is not the benevolent
organization that you think it is!

01:02.929 --> 01:04.988
But Chelsea...

01:06.833 --> 01:09.131
How do you explain that?

01:11.638 --> 01:13.071
I found you!

01:27.954 --> 01:30.514
I've been waiting for you,
wind user.

01:30.590 --> 01:33.423
If you know my name, then...

01:35.929 --> 01:37.123
I'm with the Company.

01:52.579 --> 01:56.208
This might be something
worth seeing.

02:07.293 --> 02:08.726
Ruri!

02:12.799 --> 02:13.697
Rumina...

02:19.038 --> 02:20.665
Your head is mine!

02:42.428 --> 02:46.364
The city at night is so cold

02:46.432 --> 02:49.868
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

02:49.936 --> 02:53.463
I wonder if I can keep going

02:53.540 --> 02:56.134
The important thing...

02:56.209 --> 02:58.200
You must tell me

02:58.278 --> 02:59.643
Please

03:00.046 --> 03:05.109
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

03:05.185 --> 03:09.849
Tell me that's not true

03:10.590 --> 03:14.356
I loved you so much that it hurt

03:14.427 --> 03:18.022
Everything was sparkling all around

03:18.097 --> 03:21.498
There was nothing to be afraid of

03:21.568 --> 03:25.163
I believed in that

03:25.238 --> 03:28.867
That moment when
my passions stirred

03:28.942 --> 03:32.378
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

03:32.445 --> 03:35.846
I will never forget that moment

03:35.915 --> 03:39.476
I will never say I want to go back

03:39.552 --> 03:45.286
I just want to see you one more time

03:59.172 --> 04:02.375
Raid - The Broken Bonds
Raid - The Broken Bonds.

04:02.375 --> 04:05.970
Raid - The Broken Bonds

04:12.452 --> 04:13.680
You're in my way!

04:15.888 --> 04:17.515
Outta my way!

04:22.895 --> 04:24.192
Not so fast, kid!

04:24.797 --> 04:26.389
Smoke Blast Attack!

04:43.816 --> 04:47.252
That Rumina sure likes to do
whatever he wants to.

04:49.322 --> 04:53.418
And then I insert the card key,
and the door opens!

04:53.493 --> 04:54.585
Thank you very much!

04:58.731 --> 05:00.096
Thanks, Ginnosuke!

05:00.166 --> 05:00.996
I'm going!

05:01.067 --> 05:02.932
Uh, wait a minute!

05:06.973 --> 05:12.036
How can I go after Rumina
unless I get Jilherts first?!

05:12.879 --> 05:14.710
Huh? Which way was it?

05:29.529 --> 05:30.894
Wh-What happened?!

05:31.230 --> 05:32.288
Are you all right?!

05:34.367 --> 05:35.391
Perhaps...

05:37.003 --> 05:39.836
...you should take care
of yourself first?

06:02.929 --> 06:05.762
You look like
one of Pairon's goons.

06:05.832 --> 06:06.526
What?!

06:07.367 --> 06:08.334
Pairon's?!

06:15.508 --> 06:17.373
I've heard rumors about it.

06:17.677 --> 06:20.578
That in addition to his
master warriors...

06:20.646 --> 06:22.944
...he also has his own special force.

06:24.617 --> 06:28.075
And that those people
are all criminals...

06:28.154 --> 06:29.917
...and death-row inmates.

06:31.858 --> 06:33.416
You are correct.

06:35.027 --> 06:37.962
The fact that the Company
still exists...

06:38.030 --> 06:41.864
...is because we've been working
in the shadows...

06:41.934 --> 06:45.199
...to eliminate the resistance
and hunt power users!

06:46.139 --> 06:47.333
No way...

06:48.107 --> 06:49.233
In other words...

06:49.308 --> 06:52.675
...there is no way a stable society
in the Underground...

06:52.745 --> 06:55.908
...could've become a reality
without us.

06:56.916 --> 06:57.883
So?

06:58.084 --> 07:01.850
What does such a shadowy man
want with me?

07:04.290 --> 07:05.484
What do you think?

07:05.725 --> 07:07.556
I'm here to assassinate a traitor.

07:08.995 --> 07:12.192
Sorry, but I have
no interest in petty thugs.

07:13.566 --> 07:14.760
Petty thugs?!

07:16.068 --> 07:19.094
You'll see whether or not I'm a petty thug
after watching me fight!

07:21.841 --> 07:23.934
Heat Fist!

07:37.590 --> 07:39.649
I'm sure that was Rumina.

07:40.760 --> 07:42.557
Rumina has come to get me.

07:47.433 --> 07:48.957
Where do you think you're going?

07:51.437 --> 07:53.496
There's nowhere you can
escape to.

08:02.215 --> 08:03.978
It looks like everyone's started.

08:06.519 --> 08:07.451
Everyone?

08:08.087 --> 08:12.524
I can't wait to find out who's
going to be the first to die.

08:26.672 --> 08:27.696
Smoke...

08:27.974 --> 08:30.568
So this is his power, huh?

08:30.643 --> 08:32.110
That's right.

08:33.045 --> 08:37.345
My Smoke Blast is most potent
when used in small, closed spaces.

08:40.786 --> 08:42.276
Why, you!

08:51.030 --> 08:52.520
Where are you looking?

09:03.276 --> 09:05.506
That's my Wire Attack!

09:17.523 --> 09:18.683
N-No way...!

09:22.461 --> 09:23.587
She disappeared...

09:26.832 --> 09:28.527
I'm right here.

09:35.641 --> 09:37.302
She disappeared again.

09:39.145 --> 09:42.137
So this is what you look like
behind those glasses.

09:42.615 --> 09:46.415
You're much better looking
than the wind user.

09:50.623 --> 09:51.715
My, my...

09:51.791 --> 09:53.952
You look quite dumbfounded.

09:55.261 --> 09:58.025
Yes, this is my power.

09:58.664 --> 09:59.358
Shadow.

10:03.502 --> 10:05.367
I can disappear into a shadow...

10:05.438 --> 10:08.100
...and freely move within it.

10:08.774 --> 10:10.332
The power of shadows?

10:10.943 --> 10:13.411
You must be
a Company assassin!

10:13.846 --> 10:15.040
Good answer.

10:16.015 --> 10:17.073
Oh, no!

10:17.149 --> 10:18.377
I've got to tell everyone!

10:25.291 --> 10:29.193
How could you run away
and leave a pretty girl like me alone?

10:32.632 --> 10:35.157
I am already in your shadow.

10:35.234 --> 10:38.226
There is no way you can
run away from me.

10:47.747 --> 10:49.442
Heat Fist!

11:02.662 --> 11:03.492
Heat?

11:04.997 --> 11:08.057
I generate heat within my body...

11:08.134 --> 11:11.535
...and instantaneously
increase my muscle strength.

11:13.139 --> 11:14.333
I see.

11:28.287 --> 11:29.914
You stay right there!

11:29.989 --> 11:31.047
Uh, yes!

11:37.663 --> 11:39.927
Don't you get too cocky...

11:39.999 --> 11:41.796
...just because you dodged me
by fluke.

11:41.867 --> 11:45.769
I'm holding back so I don't
injure your pretty face.

11:47.006 --> 11:50.442
I don't think you should be
getting so cocky either.

11:51.077 --> 11:51.634
What?!

11:52.545 --> 11:55.742
I'm rough early in the morning.

11:56.816 --> 11:58.010
You're all talk!

11:58.350 --> 12:01.615
Well, I suppose this is
perfect for my warm-up!

12:02.722 --> 12:04.417
Don't mess with me!

12:24.543 --> 12:25.669
How could this be?!

12:48.934 --> 12:51.801
I'm still only at about
70 or 80 percent.

12:51.937 --> 12:54.872
Wasn't enough even as a warm-up.

13:00.412 --> 13:02.846
Miss Rorec!

13:09.221 --> 13:13.590
That old man Heat wasn't what
he was cooked up to be.

13:13.993 --> 13:15.858
Even with that big fist of his...

13:15.928 --> 13:17.953
...he still managed to be
easily defeated.

13:21.267 --> 13:22.734
Are you curious?

13:24.370 --> 13:26.634
The traitor won.

13:27.039 --> 13:30.304
She was your bodyguard
until recently.

13:30.376 --> 13:31.968
Chelsea Rorec.

13:33.445 --> 13:34.412
Chelsea...?!

13:36.448 --> 13:40.680
Lucky you. You'll be able to see
that gravity user soon.

13:41.720 --> 13:45.383
But only as part of my
trophy collection.

13:48.093 --> 13:50.459
You just wait quietly here.

13:51.397 --> 13:54.059
I'll go and get her right away.

13:58.070 --> 13:59.469
Wire Attack!

14:02.641 --> 14:03.869
Don't take me lightly!

14:03.943 --> 14:07.401
Getting out of traps like these
is a specialty of mine!

14:09.615 --> 14:12.516
I wonder how much longer
you'll keep up that cheer.

14:31.003 --> 14:32.664
Where are you looking?

14:32.738 --> 14:33.830
Over here.

14:36.508 --> 14:37.497
Where?

14:37.977 --> 14:39.274
Where is she?

14:43.983 --> 14:45.314
Damn! Damn!

14:45.384 --> 14:47.784
You won't get me no matter
how many times you try.

14:47.853 --> 14:49.946
I am in your shadow.

14:50.556 --> 14:53.389
You can't catch me,
and you can't escape me.

14:53.993 --> 14:55.153
She's right.

14:55.694 --> 14:58.219
In this darkness,
there's no way I can touch her.

14:58.831 --> 15:01.299
Ginnosuke, don't you be fooled!

15:02.101 --> 15:03.227
Th-That voice!

15:15.614 --> 15:17.639
Was he there the whole time?

15:19.585 --> 15:21.985
Can you see now, Ginnosuke?

15:23.822 --> 15:25.050
Master Sui!

15:26.692 --> 15:29.024
It's been a while, Ginnosuke.

15:30.496 --> 15:33.522
I-It's been such a long time...!

15:35.467 --> 15:38.197
Are you so happy that you're
brought to tears, Ginnosuke?

15:38.270 --> 15:39.601
No! That's not it!

15:39.672 --> 15:42.140
Do you know how
embarrassed I was...

15:42.207 --> 15:45.199
...because you switched that
Power Gun on me?!

15:45.277 --> 15:48.838
Don't think I'll forgive you
so easily for that!

15:48.914 --> 15:51.906
H-Hang on, Ginnosuke!

15:52.484 --> 15:53.951
Never mind me...

15:54.019 --> 15:56.010
...let's defeat the enemy before us.

15:57.923 --> 15:59.823
How are we able to see her now?

16:00.459 --> 16:01.858
She uses trickery.

16:03.028 --> 16:05.326
She uses a small amount of
nerve gas, and...

16:05.397 --> 16:08.764
...after convincing you that she
possesses the "power of shadow"...

16:08.834 --> 16:12.235
...she manipulates you into
making bad moves.

16:12.304 --> 16:13.669
Nerve gas...

16:15.207 --> 16:18.608
That's why I went
kind of dizzy before.

16:19.945 --> 16:23.312
That's the secret behind
the "power of shadow."

16:27.019 --> 16:27.747
What's this?

16:28.153 --> 16:29.814
I did promise you, after all.

16:29.955 --> 16:31.889
I've set it on low power...

16:31.957 --> 16:34.289
...so you can get three shots
with one charge.

16:34.760 --> 16:36.489
It should be easier to use now.

16:38.597 --> 16:41.191
But I want you to remember
one thing.

16:41.600 --> 16:45.559
I don't build my guns for the
purpose of hurting people.

16:46.271 --> 16:47.135
Yes!

16:55.447 --> 16:57.472
What do you want, Sound?

16:58.250 --> 17:01.913
I thought I'd just come down
and watch...

17:02.654 --> 17:05.452
...but it seems you're
having some trouble.

17:06.425 --> 17:07.119
A kid?

17:08.560 --> 17:11.996
Since they can see through
your "power of shadow"...

17:12.064 --> 17:14.794
...you don't have a chance
against the two of them.

17:15.434 --> 17:17.834
I'll lend you my puppet.

17:18.203 --> 17:19.966
I don't need it!

17:20.272 --> 17:22.797
I was one step away
from finishing him off!

17:24.643 --> 17:26.611
It doesn't look that way to me.

17:42.361 --> 17:43.020
No way!

17:43.629 --> 17:45.961
Are you sure you're allowed
to come here?

17:46.031 --> 17:47.498
What about the Maiden?

17:47.733 --> 17:49.200
Nothing to worry about.

17:49.334 --> 17:53.464
Our precious Maiden
is well tethered by my chain.

17:54.339 --> 17:57.001
I think Heat and Smoke will have
something to say about that.

17:57.242 --> 17:59.767
Oh, Heat was defeated.

18:00.412 --> 18:02.277
By Chelsea Rorec.

18:04.616 --> 18:05.981
No way...

18:06.819 --> 18:07.615
No way!

18:12.191 --> 18:13.522
Wh-Who are you?!

18:23.969 --> 18:24.993
If only...

18:25.237 --> 18:27.102
If only I had a power!

18:27.272 --> 18:29.536
I could've avoided all that grief!

18:30.542 --> 18:31.873
If only I had a power!

18:38.350 --> 18:39.248
Hexa...

18:40.652 --> 18:41.812
You were alive.

18:42.521 --> 18:45.012
Do you know this person, Master?

18:47.860 --> 18:48.519
Oh?

18:49.194 --> 18:51.321
Do you know my puppet?

18:52.431 --> 18:53.625
Puppet?

18:54.399 --> 18:55.764
How unusual.

18:55.968 --> 18:59.495
Power user hunters don't leave
any incriminating evidence behind.

19:00.372 --> 19:03.136
Master, what are
power user hunters?

19:03.742 --> 19:06.267
Anyone from the surface wouldn't...

19:06.345 --> 19:11.373
Actually, very few even down
here know of their existence.

19:13.385 --> 19:17.082
They go into the villages to
hunt down those with power...

19:17.156 --> 19:20.523
...in order to turn them
into master warriors.

19:26.965 --> 19:29.866
Those with potential
are taken away by the Company...

19:29.935 --> 19:32.870
...and those who resist are killed.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.899
She has the power of lightning.

19:36.975 --> 19:39.068
It's quite a lot of fun to see.

19:39.545 --> 19:41.740
Yeah, I'll have some fun here.

19:41.813 --> 19:44.646
And then I'm going to
take her back!

19:45.417 --> 19:46.179
Fine.

19:46.585 --> 19:49.645
But it doesn't seem like
she's interested.

19:51.957 --> 19:53.822
She is my slave.

19:54.960 --> 19:58.088
The girl you remember
is no longer here.

19:59.831 --> 20:03.130
She was reborn only to fight.

20:03.635 --> 20:06.001
All of her past memories
and human emotions...

20:06.071 --> 20:07.333
...have been erased.

20:09.474 --> 20:10.907
How could you...

20:11.143 --> 20:12.110
We can do that.

20:12.644 --> 20:14.942
That is my power.

20:18.383 --> 20:19.611
Has she really...

20:20.786 --> 20:22.686
Has she really...

20:23.689 --> 20:25.680
Has she forgotten everything?

20:27.859 --> 20:28.621
Hexa...

20:31.630 --> 20:33.655
Hexa!

20:44.243 --> 20:49.010
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.081 --> 20:55.316
As if I have a purpose

20:55.387 --> 21:06.730
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.333 --> 21:19.039
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.111 --> 21:30.511
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.523 --> 21:40.522
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.599 --> 21:44.126
I tried to listen

21:44.202 --> 21:52.405
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.477 --> 22:01.078
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.329 --> 22:12.229
Preview

22:12.698 --> 22:15.531
Master Sui isn't able to fight.

22:15.600 --> 22:18.091
He's afraid that he might
hurt Hexa.

22:18.370 --> 22:19.837
Her precious memories...

22:19.905 --> 22:22.465
...her emotions and compassion
have been erased.

22:22.541 --> 22:25.772
Right now, she doesn't see that
she's fighting Sui.

22:26.378 --> 22:27.140
Hexa!

22:27.479 --> 22:28.377
Wake up!

22:29.414 --> 22:31.905
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:32.351 --> 22:35.149
..."The Unforgettable Tragedy."

22:35.754 --> 22:40.191
The Unforgettable Tragedy.
